From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 08:52:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] phy: qcom-qmp-combo: add SM8475 (diwali) USB3/DP combo PHY
 tables

The liuqin tablet ships an SM8475 (diwali) QMP combo PHY whose PLL is a
later revision than the SM8450 (waipio) one the mainline sm8350 tables
describe; with those tables the PLL never locks and every dwc3 probe
ends in 'phy initialization timed-out'.

Import the full 173-entry diwali register table extracted from the
vendor kernel (verified byte-identical across ten diwali devices in the
vendor FDT repo) as a new sm8475_usb3dpphy_cfg with its own compatible
qcom,sm8475-qmp-usb3-dp-phy. The clock/reset writes
(QPHY_USB3_CLK_ENABLE1 in particular) are required for the PLL to lock;
on real hardware the pipe clock then measures a steady 125 MHz.

